==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|wage|wāge|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|waga|wāga|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|wēgǭ|lang=gem-pro}}, {{recons|wēgō||weight; balance, scale|lang=gem-pro}}. The second ''a'' was introduced in 1927 to distinguish it from ''[[Wagen]]''. More at {{l/en|wey}}.

